{"scene_id": "s01695", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01695.fountain", "heading": "EXT. DRIVE-IN THEATER PARKING FIELD - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "JAY", "names": ["JAY"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 13}, {"id": 1, "name": "WHITFIELD", "names": ["WHITFIELD"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 2, "name": "NORI", "names": ["NORI"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 3, "name": "VASQUEZ-HALL", "names": ["VASQUEZ-HALL"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 4, "name": "ARCHIE PLUMMER", "names": ["ARCHIE PLUMMER", "ARCHIE"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 5, "name": "SABRINA DOYLE", "names": ["SABRINA DOYLE", "SABRINA"], "gender": "?", "first": 8, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 6, "name": "GIRL WITH CAMERA", "names": ["GIRL WITH CAMERA"], "gender": "?", "first": 17, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. DRIVE-IN THEATER PARKING FIELD - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A gravel lot under a weathered screen.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Speaker posts stand in rows like headstones.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "The movie plays silent; the glow washes across a dozen parked cars.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Four teenagers sit on the hood of a rusted pickup.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "JAMAL \"JAY\" WHITFIELD (17, varsity jacket, restless) tosses a bottle cap.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "His best friend LENORE \"NORI\" VASQUEZ-HALL (17, band tee, headphones around her neck) swings her legs.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "ARCHIE PLUMMER (16, braces, thick glasses) peels a sticker off a soda can.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside them, SABRINA DOYLE (17, thrift-store dress, a camera on a strap) frames shots of the screen.", "para": 1, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ten bucks says he kisses her.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He doesn't kiss her. He dies in act three.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He doesn't die.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He dies, Archie.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've seen it?", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Twice.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then why'd we come?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because it's summer and nobody has a car that works.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hold still, Jay. Your jacket's glowing blue.", "name": "GIRL WITH CAMERA", "speaker": 6, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sabrina, I'm not posing.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It looks nice.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Does it?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Archie, are you eating the whole bag?", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a family bag.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're a family?", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're the closest thing Archie's got.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not funny.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a little funny.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Okay, a little.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So what's after this? College? Real life?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Next September.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't say it like that.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Like what?", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Like it's a funeral.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm going to Ohio.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ohio?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They have a good robotics program.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ohio. Wow.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'll be great, Arch.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Will I?", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'll be the best.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm staying here. Dad's shop.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You hate the shop.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I like the darkroom.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then take pictures of it.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I will.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "She raises the camera and fires.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "The shutter clicks.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "In the frame, three faces glow blue in the screen light, and one of them, Jay's, looks away.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What about me?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What about you?", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where do I go?", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Anywhere, Jay.", "name": "NORI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Somewhere with better snacks.", "name": "ARCHIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "They laugh.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "On the screen, the hero delivers his last line without sound.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Nori mouths along.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Jay hurls the bottle cap at the screen.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "It pings off the post.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody ever remembers the summer, they remember the end of it.", "name": "JAY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then let's make it a long one.", "name": "SABRINA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}]}